WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.334 --> 00:00:02.211
I want you
to listen closely.

00:00:02.711 --> 00:00:07.132
50% of my married clients
want to kill each other.

00:00:07.216 --> 00:00:08.258
It's normal.

00:00:08.342 --> 00:00:10.302
And here's the better news.

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:12.346
Neither one of you
is gonna kill your spouse.

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:15.516
You're many things,
but you are not murderers.

